irreducible components,
\item for every $x \in X \setminus U$ the punctured spectrum of the
strict henselization of $\mathcal{O}_{X, x}$ is connected.
\end{enumerate}
Then $\textit{F\'Et}_X \to \textit{F\'et}_U$ is fully faithful.

