\item $V_0 = V \times_U U_0$ is equal to $Y_0 \times_{X_0} U_0$
for some $Y_0 \to X_0$ finite \'etale.
\end{enumerate}
Then $V = Y \times_X U$ for some $Y \to X$ finite \'etale.

